{"id":"hunzip.1","n":"hunzip","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"hunspell-devel","ver":"1.7.0-11.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/h/hunspell-devel-1.7.0-11.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/hunzip.1.gz","sha256":"2f5a70da8d774c2e867692584703ae338593f78046365a2980177f3a9c2338dc","date":"2008-06-12","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"hunspell-tools","ver":"1.7.0-4build1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/h/hunspell/hunspell-tools_1.7.0-4build1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/hunzip.1.gz","sha256":"9b4da23f1bb277d44b0b7aa67947573af5420b878f1e5b69477add7a35661441","date":"2008-06-12","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":1,"u":1},"desc":"decompress and decrypt hzip files to the standard output","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>hunzip - decompress and decrypt hzip files to the standard output</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p>hunzip [-h] file.hz [password]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><i>Hunzip</i> is the decompression and decryption program of hzip format.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h</b></dt><dd>Display short help description.</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLE","<p><b>hunzip file.hz &gt;file</b></p>"],["NOTES","<p>Redirection of the standard output results platform-specific line terminating, so a compressed hzip file with new line terminators would be bigger with the extra CR characters of the decompression on Windows platforms.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>hunzip (1), hunspell(1)</b></p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>László Németh.</p>"]]}